0..64 Comment "// What a following result refuses. A recursive definition whose"
65..143 Comment "// result can stand above the argument it recurses on returns at no stage, and"
144..204 Comment "// a recursion through it is refused at the top. The twin of"
205..243 Comment "// `../../model/data/following.gandr`."
